<article class="ltx_document ltx_authors_1line">
<h1 class="ltx_title ltx_title_document">Improving Factuality in LLMs via Inference-Time 
<br class="ltx_break">Knowledge Graph Construction</h1>
<div class="ltx_authors">
<span class="ltx_creator ltx_role_author">
<span class="ltx_personname">Shanglin Wu
</span><span class="ltx_author_notes"><span class="ltx_author_notes_content">
